  "title": "Sweet and Kickin&#39; Mango-Habanero Hot Sauce",
  "description": "Turn up the heat because this sweet and kickin&#39; hot sauce sure isn&#39;t subtle, pairing fiery Caribbean habaneros with succulent fresh mangoes.",
  "authors": [
